flowchart LR
    E[Failed CI run + artifacts] --> N[Normalize failures]
    N --> L[Source leads + likely function]
    L --> R[Deterministic report]
    X[Optional execution and probes] --> R
    R --> B[JSON + Markdown brief]
    R -. optional .-> M[Model analysis]
    M --> F[Final artifact]
    B --> F
    F --> P[Separate publication job]
    P --> C[One updated PR comment]
